{"page":423,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:36","surah":33,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كَانَ لِمُؤْمِنٍ وَلَا مُؤْمِنَةٍ إِذَا قَضَى ٱللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ أَمْرًا أَن يَكُونَ لَهُمُ ٱلْخِيَرَةُ مِنْ أَمْرِهِمْ ۗ وَمَن يَعْصِ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ فَقَدْ ضَلَّ ضَلَـٰلًا مُّبِينًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When God and His Messenger have decided on a matter that concerns them, it is not fitting for any believing man or woman to claim freedom of choice in that matter: whoever disobeys God and His Messenger is far astray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"(it) is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِمُؤْمِنٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a believing man","transliteration":"limu'minin","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُؤْمِنَةٍ","en_gloss":"(for) a believing woman","transliteration":"mu'minatin","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَضَى","en_gloss":"Allah has decided","transliteration":"qaḍā","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has decided","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūluhu","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَمْرًا","en_gloss":"a matter","transliteration":"amran","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَكُونَ","en_gloss":"(there) should be","transliteration":"yakūna","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْخِيَرَةُ","en_gloss":"(any) choice","transliteration":"l-khiyaratu","verse_key":"33:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"33:36"},